01 WS-SLOTS-LEFT PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-REM-LEFT PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-TOTAL PIC 9(9) COMP-5.
01 LK-SLOTS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-LO PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-HI PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-RANK.
   05 LR-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LR-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LR-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LR-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-COUNT.
   05 LC-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LC-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LC-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LC-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-VALUES.
   05 LK-VALUE OCCURS 47 TIMES PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-TOTAL LK-SLOTS LK-LO LK-HI LK-RANK LK-COUNT LK-VALUES LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS WS-STATUS
    SET Z-HEAD Z-TAIL TO NULL
    IF LK-TOTAL > 5778 OR LK-SLOTS > 47 OR LK-LO < 1 OR LK-HI < LK-LO
        MOVE 110 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-DP
    COMPUTE WS-K = LK-SLOTS + 1
    COMPUTE WS-REM = LK-TOTAL + 1
    MOVE DP-R(WS-K, WS-REM) TO LK-COUNT
    IF LR-SIGN = 0 GOBACK END-IF
    MOVE LK-RANK TO WS-A MOVE LK-COUNT TO WS-B PERFORM CMP-A-B
    IF WS-CMP > 0 OR LR-SIGN < 0 MOVE 111 TO LK-STATUS GOBACK END-IF
    MOVE LK-RANK TO WS-RANK
    MOVE LK-TOTAL TO WS-REM-LEFT
    MOVE LK-SLOTS TO WS-SLOTS-LEFT
    PERFORM VARYING WS-POS FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-POS > LK-SLOTS
        PERFORM VARYING WS-X FROM LK-LO BY 1 UNTIL WS-X > LK-HI
            COMPUTE WS-REM = WS-REM-LEFT - WS-X
            IF WS-REM >= 0
                COMPUTE WS-K = WS-SLOTS-LEFT
                COMPUTE WS-REM = WS-REM + 1
                MOVE DP-R(WS-K, WS-REM) TO WS-B
                MOVE WS-RANK TO WS-A
                PERFORM CMP-A-B
                IF WS-CMP > 0
                    PERFORM SUB-A-B
                    MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-RANK
                ELSE
                    MOVE WS-X TO LK-VALUE(WS-POS)
                    SUBTRACT WS-X FROM WS-REM-LEFT
                    SUBTRACT 1 FROM WS-SLOTS-LEFT
                    EXIT PERFORM
                END-IF
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.

BUILD-DP.
    *> 索引加一：DP-K(1) 表示 0 个槽，DP-R(1) 表示余数 0。
    PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > LK-SLOTS + 1
        PERFORM VARYING WS-REM FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-REM > LK-TOTAL
            MOVE WS-ZERO TO DP-R(WS-K, WS-REM + 1)
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE 1 TO WS-SCALAR PERFORM MAKE-SMALL-OUT MOVE WS-OUT TO DP-R(1, 1)

    PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > LK-SLOTS
        PERFORM VARYING WS-REM FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-REM > LK-TOTAL
            MOVE WS-ZERO TO WS-A
            IF WS-REM > 0
                MOVE DP-R(WS-K + 1, WS-REM) TO WS-A
            END-IF
            IF WS-REM - LK-LO >= 0
                MOVE DP-R(WS-K, WS-REM - LK-LO + 1) TO WS-B
                PERFORM ADD-A-B
                MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A
            END-IF
            IF WS-REM - LK-HI - 1 >= 0
                MOVE DP-R(WS-K, WS-REM - LK-HI) TO WS-B
                PERFORM SUB-A-B
                MOVE WS-OUT TO WS-A
            END-IF
            MOVE WS-A TO DP-R(WS-K + 1, WS-REM + 1)
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM.

MAKE-SMALL-OUT.
    MOVE "FROM-SMALL" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-ZERO WS-ZERO WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
ADD-A-B.
    MOVE "ADD" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
SUB-A-B.
    MOVE "SUB" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
CMP-A-B.
    MOVE "CMP" TO WS-OP
    CALL "ORACLE-BIGINT" USING WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-OUT WS-SCALAR WS-CMP WS-SMALL WS-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK-STATUS.
CHECK-STATUS.
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 AND LK-STATUS = 0 MOVE WS-STATUS TO LK-STATUS END-IF.
END PROGRAM NORMATIVE-BOUNDED-COMPOSITION.


IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. NORMATIVE-CUTLET-PARTITION.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 CP-DP.
   05 CP-SLOTS OCCURS 18 TIMES.
      10 CP-REM OCCURS 138 TIMES.
         15 CP-HIT OCCURS 2 TIMES.
            20 CP-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
            20 CP-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
            20 CP-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
            20 CP-TAIL USAGE POINTER.

LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ZERO.
   05 Z-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 Z-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 Z-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 Z-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
